// Count of the winning labeled hammings strictly inside the least and the greatest.
// When none are strictly inside, that count is not a kept interior.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hmid ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hmid rank

IMPULSE hmid 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hmid" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
